#===========================================================================
#                               wlan_pdc.rinit
#
#  DESCRIPTION:
#    This file contains init values for WLAN PDC
#
#    Settings are obtained from TCS contents sheet maintained by Architecture
#    team alongwith collaboration from SW and HW teams. 
#
